//
// Security Hardening Invariants (Fail-Closed):
//   1. ZERO TLS/HTTPS -> Plaintext HTTP/1.0/0.9 Protocol Downgrade (`verify_no_protocol_downgrade`).
//   2. ZERO Encrypted-DNS (`DoQ`/`DoH`) -> Plaintext UDP:53 Privacy Leak unless explicitly opted in.
//   3. ZERO `Alt-Svc` SSRF / Cross-Origin / Dangerous-Port Hijacking (`validate_alt_svc_target`).
//   4. Hardened `PBLEG1.` Envelope: >= 16-byte secret, <= 1 MiB DoS cap, 128-bit nonce, 256-bit HMAC-SHA256,
